\section{Parameters: units, ranges and defaults}{
\describe{
\item{\code{groups}}{path; required. A MetaMorpheus protein-group table: AllQuantifiedProteinGroups.tsv, AllProteinGroups.tsv (no quantification, mzLib #1365) or a file's <file>_ProteinGroups.tsv. Read by ProteinGroupFromTsvFile.}
\item{\code{database}}{path; required. The UniProt XML (.xml or .xml.gz) whose GO terms annotate the members: the proteome the search used. Exactly one, because every row carries that database's sha256. A FASTA is a usage error: it carries no GO.}
\item{\code{go_obo} (wire \code{--go-obo})}{path; required. A go.obo file, which must exist. Nothing is downloaded (see proteins update-go), so the release is always one the caller chose to keep.}
\item{\code{skip_unknown_go_ids} (wire \code{--skip-unknown-go-ids})}{flag; default \code{FALSE}. Drop each GO id the database cites that the release lacks, listing it in unresolved_go_ids, instead of failing on the first run that meets one.}
\item{\code{category_map} (wire \code{--category-map})}{path; default absent. A consumer term-to-category map in mzLib's format (#!category_map_format 1, #!map_name, #!map_version; columns category, subcategory, anchor_go_id). Adds the categories table. mzLib ships no map.}
\item{\code{out}}{path; default absent; range \code{.tsv only, any case (PYB-1)}. Write the WHOLE table here with GoAnnotationTsv.Write, header included, whatever offset and limit are. Written atomically through <out>.partial. Must not name an input; its folder must exist.}
\item{\code{categories_out} (wire \code{--categories-out})}{path; default absent; range \code{.tsv only, any case (PYB-1)}. Write the category table here with GoCategoryTsv.Write. Needs category-map.}
\item{\code{offset}}{int; in \strong{rows}; default \code{0}; range \code{>= 0}. Skip this many rows in the payload.}
\item{\code{limit}}{int; in \strong{rows}; default absent; range \code{>= 0}. Return at most this many rows. Absent means every row. 0 returns only the summary, the usual pairing with out for a large run.}
}
